{"pageid":1391,"title":"Fireflies","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Fireflies</span>","revid":18561,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #1482f7; background:#0c3b6e; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n \n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Hexagon_Incorrect.png/revision/latest?cb=20250626004548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Incorrect\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Hexagon_Incorrect.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20250626004548\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Incorrect.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Incorrect.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-top:0.7em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page may contain <i>missing</i> or <i>inaccurate</i> information!</span><br />\n</p><p><span>Certain information in this page is missing or may contain inaccurate information. If you can cite where this particular information comes from, please add a citation - especially with percent calculations! The list following this notice denotes important potential inaccuracies and omissions.\n</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<pre><code>-Firefly Chances need further testing for confirmation.</code>\n</pre>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fireflies\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Main Titles\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20250605041421\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Main Titles.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Main_Titles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> Fireflies</span></h2>\n<p><b>Fireflies</b> are a resource in Oaklands; they provide an alternative means of making money that does not rely on trees or stone nodes. At night, fireflies will begin to spawn around the map in random locations (usually on the surface). These fireflies form clustered groups, illuminating the area around them. A player can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Jar\" title=\"Jar\">Jar</a> to catch them, and then can bring them back to the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a> to sell them. \n</p>\n<ul><li>Jars can easily bought at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>, although many other stores offer them as well.</li>\n<li>After an update, selling fireflies no longer consumes the Jar. Instead, it consumes the fireflies inside the jar and gives the jar back.</li></ul>\n<p>Fireflies spawn in different colors, each variation having a different value. The table below is listed by rarity, with yellow being the most common and purple being the rarest.\n</p>\n<ul><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<table style=\"margin:auto;\" class=\"sortable article-table\">\n<caption>Firefly Chances\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Yellow, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, has a ~84% or ~8/10 spawn chance.\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Green, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, has a 10% or 1/10 spawn chance.\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Red, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, has a 5% or 1/20 spawn chance.\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blue, <span style=\"color:#acbacb;\">uncommon rarity</span>, has a 0.9% or roughly ~1/100 spawn chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Purple, <span style=\"color:#ffd454;\">rare rarity</span>, is the rarest variant. Has a &lt;0.1% or 1/1000 spawn chance.\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><i>Unconfirmed</i> if weather conditions changes the spawning of fireflies.</li>\n<li>Location does <i>not</i> change the chances of a particular firefly color spawning.</li>\n<li>Using Freecam, you can see that most Fireflies do not spawn until a player is in (or travels through) the area.\n<ul><li>As such, to maximize your chances of finding rare Fireflies, drive to unloaded areas and observe the new Fireflies that spawn there.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Blue and Purple Fireflies have higher value trading compared to just selling them.</li>\n<li>All fireflies that are not bottled disappear at 6:30.</li></ul>\n<table style=\"margin:auto;\" class=\"sortable article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Color Variant\n</th>\n<th>Sell Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Yellow_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163726\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Yellow Fireflies Jar\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/17/Yellow_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240309163726\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Yellow Fireflies Jar.png\" data-image-key=\"Yellow_Fireflies_Jar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Yellow Fireflies\n</td>\n<td>$450\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/Green_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163659\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Green Fireflies Jar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Green Fireflies Jar.png\" data-image-key=\"Green_Fireflies_Jar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/87/Green_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240309163659\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Green Fireflies\n</td>\n<td>$550\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/09/Red_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163628\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Red Fireflies Jar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Red Fireflies Jar.png\" data-image-key=\"Red_Fireflies_Jar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/09/Red_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240309163628\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Red Fireflies\n</td>\n<td>$800\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Blue_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163404\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blue Fireflies Jar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blue Fireflies Jar.png\" data-image-key=\"Blue_Fireflies_Jar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ae/Blue_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240309163404\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Blue Fireflies\n</td>\n<td>$2,400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/06/Purple_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163140\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Purple Fireflies Jar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Purple Fireflies Jar.png\" data-image-key=\"Purple_Fireflies_Jar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/06/Purple_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20240309163140\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Purple Fireflies\n</td>\n<td>$4,400\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Events\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/24/Hexagon_Special.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616221100\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Special\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Special.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Special.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/24/Hexagon_Special.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250616221100\" /></a></span> Events</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2023_and_2024_Halloween_Ghosts\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" /></a></span> 2023 and 2024 Halloween Ghosts</span></h3>\n<p>During Halloween 2023/2024, fireflies were replaced by <b>Ghosts</b>. While they were otherwise functionally identical, Ghosts had the quirk of not disappearing during the day. Ghosts were sold for the event currency, Candy, instead of for money. Player would receive their empty Jar back. The chances for the colors of Ghosts is likely the same.\n</p>\n<table style=\"margin:auto;\" class=\"sortable article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Color Variant\n</th>\n<th>Sell Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5b/YellowGhosts.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023031920\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"YellowGhosts\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"59\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"YellowGhosts.png\" data-image-key=\"YellowGhosts.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5b/YellowGhosts.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/59?cb=20241023031920\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Yellow Ghosts\n</td>\n<td>450 Candy\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/GreenGhosts.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023031921\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"GreenGhosts\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"58\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GreenGhosts.png\" data-image-key=\"GreenGhosts.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/3e/GreenGhosts.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/58?cb=20241023031921\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Green Ghosts\n</td>\n<td>550 Candy\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/53/RedGhosts.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023032309\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RedGhosts\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"RedGhosts.png\" data-image-key=\"RedGhosts.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/53/RedGhosts.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/56?cb=20241023032309\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Red Ghosts\n</td>\n<td>800 Candy\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/32/BlueGhosts.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023031921\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"BlueGhosts\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BlueGhosts.png\" data-image-key=\"BlueGhosts.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/32/BlueGhosts.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/56?cb=20241023031921\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Blue Ghosts\n</td>\n<td>2400 Candy\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/PurppleGhosts.png/revision/latest?cb=20241023031921\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"PurppleGhosts\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"58\" height=\"101\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PurppleGhosts.png\" data-image-key=\"PurppleGhosts.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a8/PurppleGhosts.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/58?cb=20241023031921\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>Jar of Purple Ghosts\n</td>\n<td>3400 Candy\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Hexagon_Question.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616224254\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Question\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Question.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Question.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Hexagon_Question.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250616224254\" /></a></span> Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>For a time after the 2023 Halloween Update, fireflies inherited the quirk of ghosts, where they did not disappear during the daytime. This glitch was rectified in a later update.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903004729\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 35/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 629/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.450      1 Template:Missing_Info\n100.00%    1.450      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcac